{"name":"The Broken Glass","slug":"glyph-broken-glass","blurb":"On the voice street, Zinn carries the glass toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Broken. Click the glass and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Broken Glass.","seal":"e34ac643b7ab4d32c440cbb5052ae00e3565a1c98253cbe4b0103ca2eefb02c7"}
